# Build context exclusions for the gm-kms Docker image.
# The Dockerfile only needs: Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/, src/, examples/,
# and kms.toml.example. Everything else is excluded to keep the build context small.

target/
.git/
.github/
docs/
deploy/
operators/
sdk/
fuzz/
tests/
benches/

# Documentation and project meta
*.md
LICENSE
LICENSE-APACHE
LICENSE-MIT
NOTICE
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
SECURITY.zh-CN.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
OSS_*
gm-*

# Editor / tooling
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.dockerignore
